 "limitations": [
  "Everything ran in simulation. The B02 MQTT broker is not in the day loop (it runs on wall time); B02 enters as its Matter data-model round trip, HA discovery configs and the measured 15 s Last Will, modelled.",
  "Seeds per fault mix were reduced to keep the run under about 3 minutes on 2 shared cores.",
  "The fleet is a lightweight model: availability, ring sizes, soak, halt threshold, operator delay and the quiet bad update are assumptions. Only the loud bad update's effect on a home's health report and the good version's false-failing share come from twin days.",
  "Voices in the day are the bundled household embeddings; B05 stage times are the mini PC tier (measured on this CPU, scaled where marked in B05). No LLM was run.",
  "No real cloud was used. Product features beyond docs/facts-ledger.md rows 8a-8c were not verified (documentation pages could not be opened from this machine)."
 ]
